        "created_at": "2022-11-30T21:03:21.506Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That’s great!  And I really think that’s what the designers intend twists to be.  Not wholly or even primarily a mechanical cost, but an opportunity to move the story in a direction no one expected.</p>",
